READING
==============================================================================
A high `with files` rate on DECLARED DECLINE and a low one on CASUALTY is
what makes C-110's artifact condition discriminating rather than merely
strict. A declined leg that preserved nothing does not earn the status --
and by PRODUCT_CONTRACT 4 it also failed to preserve what a no-PWML
outcome owes, so reporting it as unawarded is the honest answer, not a
false negative.

